id: pm-x4wbui
title: Unknown-option refusal textual flags bypass structured global-option filtering
description: CodeRabbit review on PR #1133 found that resolveRefusalCandidateFlag may select the first flag mentioned in guidance prose before its structured provided_fields scan excludes global flags. A message naming --json before invalid --depth can therefore report the global flag and its following argument instead of the rejected option. Apply one admissibility predicate to both paths and prove exact surface/value attribution.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[6]: agent-ux,"area:cli","area:sdk",contracts,recovery,review-feedback
